        <div class="story-text">
          <h2>Our Story</h2>
          <p>Founded in 1997, Cutting Edge Concrete Cutting began with a simple mission: to provide unmatched precision and reliability in concrete cutting, sawing, and coring services. As a family-owned and operated business, we've built our reputation on integrity, craftsmanship, and an unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction.</p>
          
          <p>Over the past 26+ years, we've completed over 1,500 projects across Southern California—from residential renovations to large-scale commercial developments. What sets us apart is our dedication to doing all work with a consistent quality and direct accountability on every job.</p>

          <p>Our team arrives at every project fully prepared—water tanks filled, generators fueled, and equipment ready to work. This commitment to efficiency and professionalism has enabled us to maintain a strong reputation and a loyal customer base that continues to grow.</p>
        </div>
